    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A beautiful bright and very spacious 2 Bedroom (2 Bath) First Floor Apartment situated in this superbly convenient development within walking distance of all the amenities and services on offer in the vibrant town of Kilcock such as schools, shops, restaurants, cafes, sporting and recreational amenities and indeed the excellent and ever expanding commuter services of train and bus. The property is located within a short driving distance of Motorway and takes only about 6 to 7 minutes to drive to the University town of Maynooth nearby, 15 mins to 25 mins of major Kildare towns such as Clane, Newbridge, Naas etc etc. Approx commute time to Dublin Airport is 25 mins and 15 mins to Liffey Valley Shopping Centre etc - all illustrating the excellent location this property enjoys. In addition this property boasts an excellent Ber Energy Rating of B3 making it qualify for discounted green mortgage interest rates not to mention practical comfort and economical efficiency. As it is first floor in this development it benefits from lots of light and privacy with its southwesterly orientation throwing sun, light and heat onto the balcony off the livingroom plus the veranda off the master bedroom at the rear . The property enjoys Gas Fired Central Heating and Double Glazed windows.\r\nComprising Entrance Hall with stairway to Landing which has Hotpress and Attic Access off, Open Plan Kitchen/Dining/Livingroom with Veranda off, Master Bedroom which has ensuite off and veranda overlooking large Green area, 2nd bedroom and separate Bathroom, this property provides excellent accomodation in an excellent location and excellent value to all prospective buyers. This property is located in a small cul de sac and is not overlooked to front or rear.\r\nViewing is very highly recommended by appointment with the Agent Brid Feely MIPAV on 0872052649\r\n\r\nPRICE REGION 259,000.00 EURO                                 BER CERT ; B3"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - Stairway to Landing\r\n\r\nLanding - Wooden floor. Light tunnel. Spotlights. Attic Access Door. Hotpress off. Coving.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining/Living Open Plan - Laminate Wooden floor. Coving and Spotlights. Extensive range of Shaker Kitchen units with stainless steel sink, Integrated Oven, Hob and extractor fan. Tiled splashback. Free standing Fridge/freezer and dishwasher. Southwesterly facing Veranda off the Living area.\r\n\r\nUtility area ; located off the Kitchen area. Plumbed for washing machine.\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom - Carpeted floor. Built in wardrobes. French doors onto rear Veranda overlooking large scenic Green area. Door to Ensuite\r\n\r\nEnsuite - Tiled floor and partly tiled walls. WC, WHB and Shower Cubicle with electric shower and tiled surround. Extractor fan.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - Laminate wooden floor. Built in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBathroom - Tiled floor and partly tiled walls. Light tunnel. WC, WHB and Bath with shower mixer. Extractor fan."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "ADDITIONAL FEATURES ;\r\n\r\nExcellent Ber Energy rating of B3 ensuring buyer can available of the Green discounted mortgage interest rates and enjoy comfort and economic efficiency on a daily basis.\r\nGas Fired Central Heating and Double Glazed windows.\r\nModern Open Plan living/kitchen/dining area.\r\nSouthwesterly facing Veranda which is a sun trap from Livingroom to front\r\nEasterly facing Veranda overlooking Green area from Master Bedroom at rear.\r\nEnjoying a Green area to the front and a large Green area to the rear.\r\nBenefiting from light throughout the apartment front and back due to its first floor location.\r\nWithin short walking distance to schools, shops, restaurants, bus and train etc etc.\r\nQuick access onto the Motorway and all routes to Dublin city centre, Liffey Valley and Blanchardstown shopping centres, Airport, and large Kildare hubs and towns such as Maynooth, Naas, Newbridge etc etc."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
